osoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           建议养豆：2周\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：橙子、黄柠檬、绿茶感\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Orange, Lemon, Green tea-like\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          今年的日晒相比去年的批次发酵感会弱一些，偏向传统日晒；杯测时的表现会偏轻微的热带水果，像番石榴和杏桃果肉的感觉，中温还会有类似水洗的那种芒果香气，温度再降下来时会有偏水洗的红薯甜感；手冲时就特别的清新的咖啡花香，树莓转蓝莓的果香，非常顺滑，中温蓝莓的香气和咬下去的果肉感更凸显一些；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          水洗批次就比较传统，感觉没有经过什么发酵的过程，整体的酸质很轻盈，他没有Rumudamo那么强度高的香气，但是它的甜感特别高，从高温开始一路到中温都很像脐橙和沃柑的酸甜柑橘调性；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\